<title>SINGAPORE: Liang Court appoints new directors.</title>
<headline>Liang Court appoints new directors.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property group Liang Court Holdings Ltd said on Friday that it has appointed three new directors.</p>
<p>They are Kwa Soon Bee, Stanley Quek and Paul Chain.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080 ds val</p>
